        "image_position": "left",
        "tag": "Our story",
        "quote": "“We started Sonnet Wellness because we believed skincare could work with skin, not against it.”",
        "quote_size": 48,
        "text": "<p>Rather than stripping everything away and starting from scratch, we wanted to help skin maintain its own natural balance.</p>",
