        "text": "<p>Our formulations start with the skin barrier. Rather than stripping everything away and starting over, each product is built to help maintain a comfortable, conditioned skin surface — pairing postbiotic Lactobacillus Ferment Lysate with actives already established in cosmetic science, like Niacinamide and Glycolic Acid, at concentrations backed by their own formulation data.</p>",
