          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does \"postbiotic\" mean?",
            "answer": "<p>A postbiotic is an inactivated bacterial ferment lysate, not a live culture. Our postbiotic, Lactobacillus Ferment Lysate, helps maintain a comfortable, conditioned skin surface.</p>"
